LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_ItsPaintingOfPokemon:: @ 818831A
	.string "It's a painting of POKeeMON.$"

LilycoveCity_LilycoveMuseum_2F_Text_NewPaintingsSurprisedMe:: @ 8188336
