@ ===== PacifidlogTown_House5 =====
PacifidlogTown_House5_Text_CantSeeMirageIslandToday:: @ 8179718
	.string "I can't see MIRAGE ISLAND today...$"

PacifidlogTown_House5_Text_CanSeeMirageIslandToday:: @ 817973B
