Route110_Text_16F429:: @ 816F429
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "The foe can be made helpless by\n"
	.string "paralyzing it or causing it to sleep.\p"
	.string "It is an important technique for\n"
	.string "POKeeMON battles.$"

