	.string "cottage by the sea.\p"
	.string "He goes for walks in the tunnel every\n"
	.string "so often.$"

RustboroCity_Text_MrBrineyLovesPeeko:: @ 8166BEF
	.string "The old sailor MR. BRINEY lives in a\n"
	.string "cottage by the sea.\p"
	.string "He said he was going shopping in\n"
	.string "SLATEPORT for his pet, PEEKO.\p"
	.string "That old seadog, he must really love\n"
	.string "that PEEKO.$"

RustboroCity_Text_WowYouHavePokemon:: @ 8166C98
	.string "Wow, you have POKeeMON with you, too.\p"
	.string "When I get bigger, I'm going to go\n"
	.string "places with POKeeMON, too.$"

RustboroCity_Text_CatchRarePokemonIfIGoToSchool:: @ 8166CFA
	.string "POKeeMON TRAINER'S SCHOOL!\p"
	.string "If I go to this school, will I be able\n"
	.string "to catch rare POKeeMON easily?$"

RustboroCity_Text_PokemonCanChangeLookFromExp:: @ 8166D59
	.string "If a POKeeMON gains experience in\n"
	.string "battles, it can sometimes change in\l"
	.string "the way it looks.$"

RustboroCity_Text_PokemonChangeShape:: @ 8166DB0
	.string "A POKeeMON changes shape?\n"
	.string "If one did that, I would be shocked!$"

RustboroCity_Text_TradePokemonGrowFast:: @ 8166DEE
	.string "A POKeeMON you get in a trade from\n"
