SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OceanicMinifact1:: @ 817E944
	.string "eeeOCEANIC MINI FACT 1\n"
	.string "Why is seawater blue?\p"
	.string "eeeLight is composed of many colors.\p"
	.string "eeeWhen light passes through water,\n"
	.string "most kinds of light lose color.\p"
	.string "eeeHowever, blue light retains its\n"
	.string "color, making the sea appear blue.eee$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OceanicMinifact2:: @ 817EA19
	.string "eeeOCEANIC MINI FACT 2\n"
	.string "Why is the sea salty?\p"
	.string "eeeSeawater contains dissolved salt in\n"
	.string "the form of sodium and chlorine ions.\p"
	.string "eeeThese ions leach out of rocks and are\n"
	.string "carried out to sea by rain.\p"
	.string "eeeThe concentration of dissolved salt\n"
	.string "makes the sea salty.eee$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_OceanicMinifact3:: @ 817EB0D
